[Cheonji Ilbo Goheung = Reporter Lee Bong-hwa] The 15th Goheung Aerospace Festival, held from May 3 to 6 under the slogan &ldquo;From Earth Civilization to Space Civilization,&rdquo; garnered nationwide attention.

Among the 120,000 visitors, approximately 97% were from outside the region, with each spending an average of 110,000 KRW, generating an estimated 12.6 billion KRW in economic impact.

Without celebrity performances, the festival focused solely on space and science experience programs, receiving high praise as a &ldquo;profitable festival.&rdquo;

Unique content exclusive to Goheung, such as the actual Nuri rocket model and rover demonstrations, also drew acclaim.

Goheung County plans to continue hosting this distinctive festival every May to promote its image as Korea&rsquo;s aerospace hub.

